WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,280
coal fool

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:07,360
Do you think I've become a fool like you?

3
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,360
Today's world

4
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,680
Coal is more valuable than gold

5
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,200
Every household can’t grab it

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,640
You take the furniture from a run-down house

7
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:13,640
Just want to exchange for my coal

8
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,000
Go ahead and dream of your pure ball dream

9
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,480
Who said I want gold charcoal?

10
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:22,480
What I want is the stone coal and crane coal that you don’t want.

11
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,700
That thing is a poisonous stone

12
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,500
It's hard to burn and not warm.

13
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,460
People who are still suffering from the smoke can't open their eyes and can only cough.

14
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,020
Give it to the poor for nothing and no one wants it

15
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:32,740
That stone coal is a waste material brought out from the mining of fine coal stone.

16
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,180
It's full of rocks and debris

17
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:35,900
This kid is afraid that Shitou is going crazy.

18
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,100
Don’t want a good house

19
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,580
In exchange for a pile of poisonous stones

20
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,780
Prophet Mu Chuan

21
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,340
Don't be stupid

22
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,500
That's not coal at all

23
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,940
Burning will kill people

24
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:46,020
Someone in the village used to use that thing to keep warm.

25
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:50,060
A family of three who were all smoked the next day. Uncle Zhao Quan gave it to you in vain.

26
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:52,060
I have books in my heart, should I change them?

27
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:54,140
I want to use room appliances and floor appliances

28
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:56,340
Can I trade with you for stone coal and crane coal?
